n></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Medium Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Medium Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7e/Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094325\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quiz\" title=\"Quiz\">Quiz</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Complete the quiz</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nFrom the <a href=\"/wiki/Wenye_Beach\" title=\"Wenye Beach\">Wenye Beach</a> resonance beacon, instead of heading east towards the quest marker, turn south and jump down the hole next to the camp with <a href=\"/wiki/Sanshi\" title=\"Sanshi\">Sanshi</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lazing_Around_Researcher\" title=\"Lazing Around Researcher\">Lazing Around Researcher</a>. Once you're inside the underground cave, follow the path and turn left at the crossroad. <a href=\"/wiki/Quiz\" title=\"Quiz\">Quiz</a> is under the awning.</p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"b596dca3ecbb8fa257b2ed95953433eb\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"A_Quest_of_Wits_location-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:A_Quest_of_Wits_location.png\" title=\"A Quest of Wits location.png (3.06 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fa/A_Quest_of_Wits_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240919230615\" title=\"A Quest of Wits location.png (3.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Entrance to underground cave south of Wenye Beach resonance beacon\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"A Quest of Wits location.png\" data-image-key=\"A_Quest_of_Wits_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Entrance to underground cave south of Wenye Beach resonance beacon\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"A Quest of Wits location.png (3.06 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Entrance to underground cave south of Wenye Beach resonance beacon\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"A Quest of Wits location.png\" data-image-key=\"A_Quest_of_Wits_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Entrance to underground cave south of Wenye Beach resonance beacon\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fa/A_Quest_of_Wits_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240919230615\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Entrance to underground cave south of Wenye Beach resonance beacon</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Quiz_location-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Quiz_location.png\" title=\"Quiz location.png (2.47 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/56/Quiz_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240919230715\" title=\"Quiz location.png (2.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Quiz (NPC) location\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Quiz location.png\" data-image-key=\"Quiz_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Quiz (NPC) location\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Quiz location.png (2.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Quiz (NPC) location\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Quiz location.png\" data-image-key=\"Quiz_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Quiz (NPC) location\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/56/Quiz_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240919230715\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Quiz (NPC) location</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This quest unlocks 24 hours after finishing <a href=\"/wiki/A_Quest_of_Wits_-_I\" title=\"A Quest of Wits - I\">A Quest of Wits - I</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You meet a strange dual in the Dim Forest. They seem to have peculiar questions for you. Answer their questions correctly, and you might receive some rewards.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Quiz:</b> Quizzes about Jinzhou. Come if you feel curious!</dd>\n<dd><b>Quiz:</b> Everything counts here. Answer and get rewarded!</dd>\n<dd><b>Quiz:</b> O the Rover passing by. Pop in for a challenge.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Another one?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Let's go.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Quiz:</b> Quiz Number Two. Who do you ask for peace?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Patrol Station.\n<dl><dd><b>Quiz:</b> Quiz Number Two, answer! Ask Patrol Station for peace.</dd>\n<dd><b>Quiz:</b> Take your reward and come back for more tomorrow!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Academy.\n<dl><dd><b>Quiz:</b> Difficulties arive. Rover confused.</dd>\n<dd><b>Quiz:</b> If you see it through, return and be my guest!</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>A Quest of Wits - II</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">曲问趣答・二</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span